## Tournaments and Matches

### Object Types

| ID | Name | Description |
|----|------|-------------|
| worldcup_en_tournaments | Tournaments | Tournament editions and winners. The snapshot has 22 men’s editions through 2022 and eight women’s editions through 2019. |
| worldcup_en_tournament_stages | Tournament Stages | Stages within each tournament, including schedule and progression flags. |
| worldcup_en_matches | Matches | One match, with designated home and away sides, scores and stage. These designations do not establish the host-country team. Regulation/extra-time scores and shootout scores are separate. |
| worldcup_en_stadiums | Stadiums | Stadium identities, location and recorded capacity. |
| worldcup_en_host_countries | Host Countries | Host-country records. A tournament can have more than one host. |
| worldcup_en_groups | Groups | Tournament group structure, including the stage and group size. |
| worldcup_en_group_standings | Group Standings | One team’s standings in a tournament group. Use tournament, group and team together. |
| worldcup_en_tournament_standings | Tournament Standings | Final tournament rankings and totals for recorded teams. |
